  "label": "Islamophobic Stereotype: Equating Muslim men with animals",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Muslim men are inherently untruthful or unreporting due to cultural or religious reasons, by comparing them to goats — animals that cannot speak. This is a form of Islamophobic tropes that degrades the community by suggesting their experiences are not valid or that they are incapable of reporting crimes due to inherent traits.",
